The '''Castejón Metro Takamaicán Line''' ({{Lang-bl|Linia de Metro de Castejón a Takamaicán}}) is a [[W:Rapid transit|subway]] line in [[Castejón]], Balisca, operated by [[Castejón Metro]]. The line runs between [[Itápyta Station]] in [[Trinacria]] and [[Alazán Station]] in [[Alquézar]]. The official name is '''Line 10 Takamaicán Line'''.

The line was named after the [[Takamaicán]] barrio in the [[Coruxón]] borough, under which it passes. On maps, diagrams and signboards, the line is shown using the color [[W:Shades of blue|sky blue]], and its stations are given numbers using the letter "T". 

